04246E             0311*   ; gets time remaining on a countdown timer following the global timestamp
04246E             0312*   ; inputs: iy = pointer to 3-byte buffer holding start time,iy+3 = pointer to 3-byte buffer holding timer set value
04246E             0313*   ; requires: timestamp_tick to be called at least once before this function
04246E             0314*   ; returns: hl pos = time remaining in 1/120ths of a second,hl neg = time past expiration
04246E             0315*   ;          sign flags: pos = time not expired,zero or neg = time expired
